<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $400,000</p>
<p>men's Toulouse tennis Grand Prix on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>8-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Orlin Stanoichev (Bulgaria) beat Thierry Guardiola (France) 5-7</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Bernd Karbacher (Germany) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(12-10)</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 5-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) -</p>
<p>walkover</p>
</text>
